  "blocks": [
    {
      "discriminant": "introPortraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Projekt-Intro poster",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/0/value/media.gif",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "How much stubborn individuality can a text typeface possess before it ceases to be functional? ~And does it ever need to apologize for it?~\n\nThousands of anchor points, endless optical corrections, and the craft of the manual within the digital. Every curve was drawn by hand in ~Glyphs 3~, discarded, and readjusted. Building typography from scratch radically transformed how I perceive radii and counters, you learn to stop thinking in letters and start thinking in realms of light and shadow.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeStandard",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Wörter",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/1/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Untertitel",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/2/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "eigentlich",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/3/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "Diving headfirst into type design for the very first time means completely reimagining your favorite creative tool. The initial concept for Désolé Book was born amidst the vibrant clamor of ~Marseille’s backstreets~, eventually crystallizing in Vienna under the cinematic spell of the ~Nouvelle Vague~.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeStandard",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "ABC",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/4/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Text in allen sizes",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/5/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeStandard",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Yoko",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/6/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitNoText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "a Glyphe",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/7/value/media.gif",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "mobileFullWidth": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Formen",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/8/value/media.gif",
        "hasAudio": false
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Linien",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/9/value/media.jpg",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "The result is a typeface built upon the architecture of a sturdy slab serif, one that excels as ~body copy~, yet unapologetically refuses to be tame or invisible. It carries an imperfect, deeply personal soul in its glyphs, standing tall with a confidence that ~never~ asks for forgiveness.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "portraitWithText",
      "value": {
        "adminLabel": "Zine",
        "media": "/images/content/desole/blocks/10/value/media.gif",
        "hasAudio": false,
        "text": "The allure lay in crafting a typeface that feels familiar and dependable at first glance, yet reveals a sharp, rebellious streak in its details. Much like the cinema of the French New Wave, Désolé ~breaks traditional~ conventions without sacrificing legibility.",
        "textSize": "normal"
      }
    },
    {
      "discriminant": "landscapeFullWidth",
